(88,71,'hlj',NULL,'1/144 RG MSN-06S Sinanju','<p>Gundam Unicorn have been waiting a long time for this one!&amp;amp;nbsp; The Sinanju finally gets a Real Grade kit and wow is it detailed.&amp;amp;nbsp; The emblem parts are golden-plated for superior detail and the red parts feature a smooth glossy finish for extra impact!&amp;amp;nbsp;All parts come molded in multiple colors with stickers provided to add extra colors and markings. &amp;amp;nbsp;</p>',NULL,'2025-12-24 20:56:10','2025-12-24 20:56:10'),
