(94,77,'hlj',NULL,'1/100 MG V2 Gundam Ver.Ka','<p>It&amp;amp;rsquo;s the LM314V21 Victory Two Gundam!&amp;amp;nbsp; From the popular &amp;amp;ldquo;Mobile Suit Victory Gundam&amp;amp;rdquo; anime series, the V2 has finally got the Master Grade treatment and Ver. Ka -ed by the legendary mecha designer, Katoki Hajime!&amp;amp;nbsp; This kit comes molded in multiple colors and features a snap fit construction.&amp;amp;nbsp; The weapons included are a Beam Rifle / Grenade Launcher and a clear pink beam shield.&amp;amp;nbsp; Three 1/100 scale figures are included: two pilot figures so you can have your choice of Uso Ewin or Marbet Fingerhat in the cockpit, and a Shakti Kareen standing figure.&amp;amp;nbsp; Foil stickers and a sheet of water-slide decals are included for the markings.&amp;amp;nbsp; This kit can also transform to make the Core Fighter, Top Fighter and Bottom Fighter.&amp;amp;nbsp; And just like in the show the Core Fighter can be docked with either the Top or Bottom Fighter! &amp;amp;nbsp;</p>',NULL,'2025-12-24 21:06:29','2025-12-24 21:06:29'),
