(102,89,'hlj',NULL,'1/144 HGBF Gundam Amazing Exia','<p>From Gundam Build Fighters, here comes a nicely detailed kit of the Gundam Amazing Exia! &amp;amp;nbsp;Fully posable after assembly, it comes with the Amazing GN Sword for its right hand, the Amazing GN Shield for its left hand, and an Amazing GN Blade to be mounted to one hip. The GN Drive to activate the Trans-Am Booster is also included! &amp;amp;nbsp;Make room in your Gundam lineup for this versatile unit!&amp;amp;nbsp;</p>',NULL,'2025-12-24 21:27:19','2025-12-24 21:27:19'),
