(117,102,'hlj',NULL,'1/144 RG ZGMF-X20A Strike Freedom Gundam','<p>The Real Grade Strike Freedom is the first RG kit with the frame molded in this gold color. &amp;amp;nbsp;The Dragoons even feature gold plating for that beautiful result right out of the box. Does not include a stand.</p>',NULL,'2025-12-24 21:48:58','2025-12-24 21:48:58'),
