(121,104,'hlj',NULL,'1/144 HGUC NZ-666 Kshatriya Repaired','<p>Repaired and ready to fight, it&amp;amp;#39;s the final form of the NZ-666 Kshatriya mobile suit from Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn ! Even at 1/144 scale, this is one huge Gunpla that will take a lot of shelf space! This snap-fit-assembly kit comes molded in color, features articulated joints and includes the Hyper Beam Javelin, missiles and stickers for details.</p>',NULL,'2025-12-24 21:52:07','2025-12-24 21:52:07'),
