(126,108,'hlj',NULL,'1/144 RG Zeta Gundam','<p>Bandai marks the 10th release in their Real Grade line with the mighty Zeta Gundam. &amp;amp;nbsp;In the anime, and in MG and PG kit forms, the Zeta transforms into its Wave Rider form and the big question being asked when Bandai announced an RG Zeta was if it would a transforming kit. &amp;amp;nbsp;And it is! &amp;amp;nbsp;Bandai&amp;amp;#39;s RG MS Advanced Joint frame took 1/144 scale kits to a whole new level and the Zeta raises the bar again thanks to the amazing transformation engineering. &amp;amp;nbsp;Like previous RGs the Zeta features various armor color tones as well as an abundance of marking stickers but this guy can transform!</p>',NULL,'2025-12-24 21:58:52','2025-12-24 21:58:52'),
(127,109,'plamod',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','2025-12-24 22:00:23','2025-12-24 22:00:23'),
(128,109,'hlj',NULL,'1/100 MG Aegis Gundam','<p>Another great SEED Master Grade kit from Bandai, with a twist. &amp;amp;nbsp;Well, actually several twists.. and turns.. as you transform the Aegis Gundam into its Mobile Armor form. That&amp;amp;#39;s right, the MG Aegis transforms! &amp;amp;nbsp;No part swapping is used in the transformation which is a tribute to the amazing design and engineering from Bandai. &amp;amp;nbsp;Stand not included.&amp;amp;nbsp;</p>',NULL,'2025-12-24 22:00:25','2025-12-24 22:00:25'),
(129,110,'plamod',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','2025-12-24 22:01:56','2025-12-24 22:01:56'),
(130,110,'hlj',NULL,'1/100 MG Buster Gundam','<p>Another great SEED Master Grade suit from Bandai! &amp;amp;nbsp;Buster is his big self complete with those massive guns he sports on his back, which can also connect together to make an even bigger weapon! &amp;amp;nbsp;Thanks to the amazing design of the weapon arms attached to Buster&amp;amp;#39;s hips he can hold those massive weapons in a variety of poses all day long.Stand not included.&amp;amp;nbsp;</p>',NULL,'2025-12-24 22:01:58','2025-12-24 22:01:58'),
(131,112,'plamod',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','2025-12-24 22:05:29','2025-12-24 22:05:29'),
