(143,119,'hlj',NULL,'1/144 HG Duel Gundam Assault Shroud (Remaster)','<p>&amp;amp;nbsp;&amp;amp;nbsp;To coincide with the 10th anniversary of Gundam Seed Bandai has rereleased this hugely popular HG kit of the Duel Gundam Assault Shroud in a &amp;amp;#39;remastered&amp;amp;#39; color reflecting those seen on the upcoming Blu-ray release. &amp;amp;nbsp;A stand attachment and marking stickers are also included in this special release.</p>',NULL,'2025-12-24 22:16:31','2025-12-24 22:16:31'),
