(146,121,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/bb-368-00-double-o-gundam-seven-sword-g-ban971079','BB #368 00 (Double O) Gundam Seven Sword /G','<p>&amp;amp;nbsp;&amp;amp;nbsp;Two years after the BB 00 Raiser release Bandai brings us the 00 Gundam Seven Sword /G! &amp;amp;nbsp;This little guy comes loaded with its GN Sword II Blaster, GN Buster Sword II, GN II Long and Short Swords, GN Beam Sabers, and more! &amp;amp;nbsp;If that wasn&amp;amp;#39;t enough 00 Gundam Seven Sword /G can also use the GN Shield that comes with the BB Qan[T] (linked below).</p>',NULL,'2025-12-24 22:19:37','2025-12-25 17:37:25'),
