(263,241,'hlj',NULL,'1/144 HG Hyakuren','<p>From the new hit series&amp;amp;nbsp; Mobile Suit Gundam: Iron-Blooded Orphans comes the Hyakuren.&amp;amp;nbsp; This 1/144 HG kit comes with parts molded in light bluish purple, dark blue, grey and white. &amp;amp;nbsp;Foil stickers for the markings are also included. &amp;amp;nbsp; &amp;amp;nbsp;</p>',NULL,'2025-12-25 01:41:44','2025-12-25 01:41:44'),
