(415,43,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/legend-bb-versal-knight-gundam-ban996729','LEGEND BB Versal Knight Gundam','<p>BB Versal Knight Gundam is molded in color, so paint isn&#039;t really necessary (although painting him will help him look even better), and foil stickers are included for the markings. </p>',NULL,'2025-12-25 19:54:52','2025-12-25 19:54:52'),
