(437,288,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/sd-gundam-ex-standard-gundam-barbatos-banh656247','SD Gundam EX Standard Gundam Barbatos','<p>Note: Bandai Hobby product orders are assigned on a first come, first served basis. Please note that if you do not receive this product after is initial released, you will be placed on the &#039;backorder&#039; list until additional stock can be allocated. The Gundam Barbatos from Mobile Suit Gundam: Iron-Blooded Orphans is now available as part of Bandai&#039;s SD Gundam EX Standard model-kit lineup! The design arrangement unique to the SD Gundam EX Standard series provides an enhanced range of motion for bold action poses. It&#039;s armed with its mace, long sword, and Barbatos smoothbore cannon; you can combine the equipment to customize it with the HG series! Order yours today![Includes]:MaceLong swordBarbatos smoothbore cannonStickers</p>',NULL,'2025-12-25 21:56:35','2025-12-25 21:56:35'),
(438,530,'panda_hobby','https://pandahobby.ca/products/entry-grade-rx-78-2-gundam-1-144?_pos=1&_sid=809405f53&_ss=r','Entry Grade RX-78-2 Gundam 1/144','<p>This super-affordable and easy-to-assemble kit is ready to introduce the joy of Gunpla to a new generation of modelers! Just snap the pre-colored parts off the trees by hand -- no tools, paint or glue are needed to build this awesome kit! It&#039;s posable after assembly, too. It&#039;s an excellent gift for new modelers and Gun</p>',NULL,'2025-12-26 18:30:33','2025-12-26 18:30:33'),
(439,530,'hobby_bee','https://hobby-bee.com/products/bandai-hobby-entry-grade-1-144-rx-78-2-gundam-mobile-suit-gundam','Bandai Hobby Entry Grade 1/144 RX-78-2 Gundam ','<p>From Bandai Hobby. Consisting of only 74 parts, the Entry Grade RX-78-2 Gundam is the ultimate introduction item for GunPla. The plastic is color molded requiring no paint, snaps together requiring no glue, uses easy twist off parts, requiring no tools, and now doesn&#039;t even require stickers for tiny details! Comes with</p>',NULL,'2025-12-26 18:30:35','2025-12-26 18:30:35'),
(440,530,'meeplemart','https://www.meeplemart.com/gundam-entry-grade-1/144-rx-78-2-gundam.aspx','Bandai - Gundam Entry Grade (1/144): RX-78-2 Gundam #5061064 5060747 [4573102610645] [4573102607478]','<p>#5061064 5060747 [4573102610645] [4573102607478] - Gundam Entry Grade (1/144): RX-78-2 Gundam</p>',NULL,'2025-12-26 18:30:57','2025-12-26 18:30:57'),
(441,530,'argama_hobby','https://argamahobby.com/products/entry-grade-eg-1-144-rx-78-2-gundam-full-weapon-set?_pos=1&_psq=ENTRY+GRADE+1%2F144+RX-78-2+Gundam&_ss=e&_v=1.0','Entry Grade (EG) 1/144 RX-78-2 Gundam (Full Weapon Set)','<p>In addition to the beam rifle and shield that come with the standard version, this Full Weapon Set for the ENTRY GRADE RX-78-2 Gundam also comes with two beam saber effects, a beam javelin, a hyper bazooka, and a Gundam hammer. Please be careful to use use nippers to remove the clear parts of the beam saber from the ru</p>',NULL,'2025-12-26 18:31:00','2025-12-26 18:31:00'),
(442,535,'panda_hobby','https://pandahobby.ca/products/builders-parts-hd-1-144-ms-hand-02-zeon-dark-gray?_pos=1&_sid=8de43a951&_ss=r','Builders Parts - HD 1/144 MS Hand 02 (ZEON) Dark Gray','<p>1/144 BUILDERS PARTS HD: MS HAND 02 ZEON DARK GRAY</p>',NULL,'2025-12-28 23:16:20','2025-12-28 23:16:20'),
(443,535,'meeplemart','https://www.meeplemart.com/builders-parts-hd-1/144-ms-hand-set-zeon-dark-gray.aspx','Bandai - Builders Parts HD (1/144): MS Hand Set 02 (Dark Gray) #5062865 0201309 [4573102628657]','<p>#5062865 0201309 [4573102628657] - Builders Parts HD (1/144): MS Hand Set 02 (Dark Gray)</p>',NULL,'2025-12-28 23:16:33','2025-12-28 23:16:33'),
(444,535,'argama_hobby','https://argamahobby.com/products/builders-parts-hd-1-144-ms-hand-02-zeon-dark-gray?_pos=1&_psq=MS+HAND+02+DARK+GRAY+%281%2F144%29&_ss=e&_v=1.0','Builders Parts - 1/144 MS Hand 02 (ZEON) Dark Gray','<p>This is an accessory or set of accessories for Gundam models.These hands feature the distinctive bulky fingers of ZEON mobile suits.Parts include:Fist (L&amp;amp;R) x2 Flat hand (L&amp;amp;R) x2Hand for weapon (L&amp;amp;R) x2top of hand x12</p>',NULL,'2025-12-28 23:16:35','2025-12-28 23:16:35');
